12:59:47 PM [express] GET /api/posts 304 in 17ms :: [{"id":11,"title":"XM Cloud Quick Overview: Sitecore's SaaS CMS","slug":"xm-cloud-quick-overview-sitecore","content":"Sitecore XM Cloud is the next evolution of Sitecore's Content Management System, moving from a platform-based approach to a fully managed, SaaS-based headless CMS. In this overview, we explore the key components that make XM Cloud the leading choice for modern digital experiences.\n\n### Key Benefits of XM Cloud:\n- **Fully Managed SaaS**: No more upgrades or infrastructure management. Sitecore handles the platform, so you can focus on content and code.\n- **Headless by Default**: Built on a modern headless architecture, allowing you to use frameworks like Next.js to deliver blazing-fast experiences.\n- **Improved Authoring**: The new Pages editor provides a lightning-fast, intuitive WYSIWYG experience for content creators.\n- **Global Delivery**: Integrated with Sitecore Experience Edge for lightning-fast content delivery across the globe.\n\n### Why Migrate to XM Cloud?\nMigrating to XM Cloud allows organizations to reduce their total cost of ownership (TCO) while increasing agility. By removing the need for traditional CM/CD server management, teams can deploy features faster and scale effortlessly.\n\n### Conclusion\nXM Cloud represents the future of Sitecore development. Whether you are starting a new project or looking to migrate from XP/XM, XM Cloud provides the tools needed to build world-class digital experiences in a composable world.","summary":"A quick overview of Sitecore XM Cloud, exploring its SaaS-based architecture, headless capabilities, and why it's the future of Sitecore development.","category":"sitecore-xm-cloud","coverImage":"attached_assets/generated_images/sitecore_xm_cloud_quick_overview_hero_image.png","published":true,"createdAt":"2026-01-11T11:43:02.387Z"},{"id":4,"title":"Upgrading to Sitecore XM Cloud","slug":"upgrading-sitecore-xm-cloud","content":"XM Cloud is the future...","summary":"What you need to know before migrating to the cloud.","category":"Sitecore XM/XP","coverImage":"attached_assets/generated_images/sitecore_xm_cloud_and_saas_transformation_visualization_replacement.png","published":true,"createdAt":"2026-01-08T14:42:16.885Z"},{"id":3,"title":"Building Headless with Sitecore JSS","slug":"building-headless-jss","content":"JSS allows front-end developers...","summary":"A deep dive into building React applications with Sitecore JSS.","category":"Sitecore JSS","coverImage":"attached_assets/generated_images/sitecore_jss_and_headless_development_digital_art_replacement.png","published":true,"createdAt":"2026-01-08T14:42:16.882Z"},{"id":2,"title":"SXA Best Practices for 2024","slug":"sxa-best-practices-2024","content":"SXA speeds up production...","summary":"Learn how to optimize your Sitecore Experience Accelerator implementation.","category":"Sitecore SXA","coverImage":"attached_assets/generated_images/sitecore_sxa_best_practices_visualization_replacement.png","published":true,"createdAt":"2026-01-08T14:42:16.878Z"},{"id":1,"title":"Getting Started with Sitecore Content Hub","slug":"getting-started-content-hub","content":"Sitecore Content Hub is a unified platform...","summary":"An introduction to the capabilities of Sitecore Content Hub for DAM and CMP.","category":"Sitecore Content Hub","coverImage":"attached_assets/generated_images/sitecore_content_hub_and_digital_asset_management_illustration_replacement.png","published":true,"createdAt":"2026-01-08T14:42:16.872Z"},{"id":8,"title":"Implementing Sitecore Search with XM Cloud","slug":"implementing-sitecore-search-xm-cloud","content":"Sitecore Search is a SaaS-based, AI-powered search and discovery solution that integrates seamlessly with Sitecore XM Cloud and other platforms. It enables flexible indexing options (via crawlers, API connectors, or ingestion APIs) and delivers fast, scalable, and personalized search experiences through REST APIs and SDKs.","summary":"Learn how to integrate AI-powered search with XM Cloud for personalized user experiences.","category":"Sitecore XM/XP","coverImage":"attached_assets/generated_images/sitecore_search_and_xm_cloud_digital_interface_replacement.png","published":true,"createdAt":"2025-09-24T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":9,"title":"Integrating Sitecore CDP with XM Cloud","slug":"integrating-sitecore-cdp-xm-cloud","content":"This guide explains how to integrate Sitecore CDP (Customer Data Platform) with a Next.js XM Cloud project. By connecting your XM Cloud frontend to Sitecore CDP, you can track sessions, send page view events, identify users, personalize content, and capture commerce interactions.","summary":"A comprehensive guide to connecting XM Cloud with Sitecore CDP for customer insights.","category":"Sitecore XM/XP","coverImage":"attached_assets/generated_images/sitecore_cdp_and_customer_insights_visualization_replacement.png","published":true,"createdAt":"2025-09-22T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":10,"title":"How to Implement Sitecore Personalization for Better User Engagement","slug":"sitecore-personalization-user-engagement","content":"Sitecore Personalization empowers businesses to create tailored experiences based on user interactions, behaviors, and demographics. By leveraging Sitecore’s powerful tools, organizations can enhance customer engagement, increase retention, and improve website performance.","summary":"Discover strategies for leveraging Sitecore tools to deliver personalized digital experiences.","category":"Sitecore XM/XP","coverImage":"attached_assets/generated_images/sitecore_personalization_and_user_engagement_concept_replacement.png","published":true,"createdAt":"2025-03-11T00:00:00.000Z"}]



































