 how to integrate AI-powered search with XM Cloud for personalized user experiences.","category":"Sitecore XM/XP","coverImage":"attached_assets/generated_images/sitecore_search_and_xm_cloud_digital_interface_replacement.png","published":true,"createdAt":"2025-09-24T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":9,"title":"Integrating Sitecore CDP with XM Cloud","slug":"integrating-sitecore-cdp-xm-cloud","content":"This guide explains how to integrate Sitecore CDP (Customer Data Platform) with a Next.js XM Cloud project. By connecting your XM Cloud frontend to Sitecore CDP, you can track sessions, send page view events, identify users, personalize content, and capture commerce interactions.","summary":"A comprehensive guide to connecting XM Cloud with Sitecore CDP for customer insights.","category":"Sitecore XM/XP","coverImage":"attached_assets/generated_images/sitecore_cdp_and_customer_insights_visualization_replacement.png","published":true,"createdAt":"2025-09-22T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":10,"title":"How to Implement Sitecore Personalization for Better User Engagement","slug":"sitecore-personalization-user-engagement","content":"Sitecore Personalization empowers businesses to create tailored experiences based on user interactions, behaviors, and demographics. By leveraging Sitecore’s powerful tools, organizations can enhance customer engagement, increase retention, and improve website performance.","summary":"Discover strategies for leveraging Sitecore tools to deliver personalized digital experiences.","category":"Sitecore XM/XP","coverImage":"attached_assets/generated_images/sitecore_personalization_and_user_engagement_concept_replacement.png","published":true,"createdAt":"2025-03-11T00:00:00.000Z"}]
